#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:73 6250392f596c48b7add6827793e07b63
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:74 7b5cc885553a400c9a923ec5332f7ec2
msgid ""
"The CSKY405 supports using its internal OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). External OSD support such as DJI or DisplayPort can be supported "
"using USART6 or any other free UART. See :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2` "
"for more info."
msgstr ""
"CSKY405 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的内置 OSD。外置 OSD 如 DJI 或 DisplayPort 可通过 "
"USART6 或其他空闲 UART 支持。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2`。"

