#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:91 9de068f9420b46ea8b93ada17d59b3d2
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:93 51b92ab5a444413095341d87c5928295
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the RX2 pin. It supports all single wire RC "
"protocols except bi-directional serial protocols such as CRSF, ELRS, etc. "
"Instead, these devices can be connected using both TX2 and RX2 if if "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 and "
":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` set to \"23\"."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 RX2 引脚上。除 CRSF、ELRS 等双向串口协议外，支持所有单线 RC 协议。若需使用这些设备，可在 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 且 "
":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 设为「23」时同时使用 TX2 和 RX2 进行连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:96 994105fb5bd0414ba463e6166d9b4ca2
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:98 66ac9c58f7b64920a7a99bf4b0cbe07b
msgid "DSM/SRXL connects to the RX2  pin."
msgstr "DSM/SRXL 连接至 RX2 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:100 a50c989b8a0644798ac8d319d00c19a4
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX2 and RX2 via a bi-directional inverter. See "
":ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr "FPort 需通过双向电平转换器连接至 TX2 和 RX2。请参阅 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:102 4ec33a09557b438a9d89f80d3d45891d
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX2 connection, in addition to RX2, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` to \"23\""
msgstr ""
"CRSF 除 RX2 外还需连接 TX2，并自动提供数传。请将 :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` "
"设为「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:104 f560ac73827e4656920b3e9d61f6b018
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX2 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\" and "
":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` set \"23\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需连接 TX2 并自动提供数传。请将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为「4」，并将 "
":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 设为「23」。"

