"这些设置在固件加载时已作为默认值设定（:ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>`"
" 除外，需从默认值手动修改）。若参数丢失，可手动设置如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:110 8b9aff3f22d542e88cbb0c7342ef742d
msgid "Enimages/CSKY405_wiring.pngable Battery monitor."
msgstr "Enimages/CSKY405_wiring.pngable Battery monitor."

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:112 247ecde6935e42a8bfa9d5eb79a15761
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` =4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` =4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:114 f9a9624f76f241f98dee31cba219d45d
msgid "Then reboot."
msgstr "然后重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:116 1d5ee28addde4da19e1a86f059a48168
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 14"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 14"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:117 0c487d28c3c3421b82569f8ac824cdce
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 7"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:118 ac00d6f61dec40a7b1094c97bdbc02da
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 21"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 21"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:119 46e309580ab04de69cfc2e7905e2d083
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10.35"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10.35"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:122 400598c330cf4d6d8a4b6b5726dbfb40
msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:124 174a1e450ccb4b349ef2a43d4a3b8297
msgid ""
"GPIO 84 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"12V\". Setting this "
"GPIO high using an :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions` or :ref:`common-relay` "
"removes voltage supply to pins."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 84 控制标有「12V」引脚的 VTX BEC 输出。通过 :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions` 或 "
":ref:`common-relay` 将该 GPIO 置高后，对应引脚断电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:127 b8bb70b07c944336a4cc3c61b6d5ce0d
msgid "Connecting a GPS/Compass module"
msgstr "连接 GPS/罗盘模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:129 0406c3bb3d3e48efbe3c2c0bd5b94b80
msgid ""
"This board does not include a GPS or compass so an :ref:`external "
"GPS/compass <common-positioning-landing-page>` should be connected as shown "
"below in order for autonomous modes to function."
msgstr ""
"该飞控板不含 GPS 或罗盘，需按下图连接 :ref:`外置 GPS/罗盘 <common-positioning-landing-page>` "
"方可使用自主飞行模式。"

