#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:139 b0c8597c5be9484fbc5dcd4858c9a6a0
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found at https://firmware.ardupilot.org in "
"sub-folders labeled CSKY405."
