#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:141 c8bd32824c5f4cd4b2f5e9eee0996c32
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the boot "
"button pressed. Then you should load the \"CSKY405_bl.hex\" firmware, using "
"your favorite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"首次固件加载可在按住 Boot 按钮插入 USB 时通过 DFU 完成。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 烧写工具加载「CSKY405_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CSKYF405.rst:145 4e535cefb7eb410781ee0ccdc730a0af
msgid "Subsequently, you can update firmware with Mission Planner."
msgstr "之后可使用 Mission Planner 更新固件。"
